{"_type":"item","id":"019dc055beeb7e058247b579214a2f70","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"Built-in 2D kinds: arrow, text, region, highlight, measure_distance/angle/radius","created_at":"2026-04-24T16:32:18","updated_at":"2026-04-25T19:00:19","tags":["annotations","built-in"],"parent":"minerva:019dc054c4167872b9cc767d9a4e25dd","resolution":"Shipped in Phase 1B Round 2. Eight kinds: arrow, text, region, polyline, highlight, measure_distance, measure_angle, measure_radius. Each implements render/hit_test/bounds. Tests in test_annotation_builtin_kinds.gd (85 assertions). Note: ink_stroke is a separate task on this plan and remains open."}
