{"_type":"item","id":"019dc05940fd7038b191435caed94894","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"Scaffold: plugin directory, manifest, Go stub, empty Godot scene","created_at":"2026-04-24T16:36:08","updated_at":"2026-04-27T01:05:42","tags":["cad","scaffold"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0552d6a774dae54e01190e0029f","resolution":"Round 1 scaffold landed in plugins repo at commit 078b567. Directory tree at ~/github/plugins/cad/ matches the agreed shape (manifest, Go shim, Python worker, Godot UI). Layer-1 verification green: go build/test clean, python pytest 217 pass / 2 skip (smoke tests skip without build123d locally), manifest parses via PluginDefinition.from_manifest. FCIB policy enforced via repo-root .gitignore. Plugin install in Godot is a separate human checkpoint not yet exercised — flagged as the manual gate for the next round."}
{"_type":"item","id":"019dc0594c9279fca103b0218c763ab3","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"Go↔Python subprocess bridge: JSON-over-stdio framing + lifetime","created_at":"2026-04-24T16:36:11","updated_at":"2026-04-27T01:34:55","tags":["bridge","cad","python"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0552d6a774dae54e01190e0029f","resolution":"Round 2 landed at commit ae0304b in ~/github/plugins. Real Go↔Python subprocess bridge per design §2-5: lazy spawn, length-prefixed framing, response correlation, crash detection, circuit breaker (3/60s), graceful shutdown. Plan-A path resolution (exec.LookPath python3); embedded PBS extract deferred to its own grandchild. End-to-end exercise via mcad_validate: cold-start 1.6s, warm path <10ms, valid/invalid sources return correct shapes. 7 bridge tests pass; skip cleanly without python3 on PATH. Reviewer-flagged hardening filed as round-3-hardening grandchildren (stderr tail 019dcc91d818, Windows compile 019dcc9201, concurrency races 019dcc9226, test gaps 019dcc92ba)."}
{"_type":"item","id":"019dc05958a97bcbb93a9b0d830ed04b","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"Port mcad/ Python package into plugin","created_at":"2026-04-24T16:36:14","updated_at":"2026-04-27T01:06:04","tags":["cad","port","python"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0552d6a774dae54e01190e0029f","resolution":"Completed as part of Round 1 scaffold (commit 078b567 in ~/github/plugins). mcad/ Python package ported byte-identically from ~/gitlab/ccsandbox/experiments/CAD/backend/mcad/ to plugins/cad/worker/mcad/. 215 inherited tests pass without modification."}
{"_type":"item","id":"019dc05964a571ed9cc6f50ee689e3f7","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"MCP tool: mcad_validate (structured parse+translate errors)","created_at":"2026-04-24T16:36:17","updated_at":"2026-04-27T01:35:00","tags":["cad","diagnostics","mcp"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0552d6a774dae54e01190e0029f","resolution":"Round 2 landed at commit ae0304b in ~/github/plugins. mcad_validate tool registered in Go (internal/tools/mcad_validate.go) and implemented in Python (worker/mcad_worker/methods.py _validate). Lex + parse stages of inherited mcad/ package; translator-stage validation deferred (translator imports build123d at module level — follow-up filed at 019dcc928a). Parse/lex errors are data inside result.errors with line/col/message per design §8.3; bridge-level errors only for internal/python kinds. 11 new pytest tests cover valid sources, lex errors, parse errors, missing/non-string source params. Live integration verified end-to-end via venv with build123d 0.10.0. Eager build123d import in methods.py partially undermines \"validate avoids OCCT\" intent — follow-up filed at 019dcc9251."}
{"_type":"item","id":"019dc0596dcf72d4bc64e2914918f279","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"MCP tool: mcad_list_edges","created_at":"2026-04-24T16:36:19","updated_at":"2026-04-27T02:25:08","tags":["cad","mcp"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0552d6a774dae54e01190e0029f","resolution":"Round 3 landed at commit 403181f in ~/github/plugins. mcad_list_edges MCP tool registered (internal/tools/mcad_list_edges.go) backed by real _evaluate + _list_edges in Python worker (worker/mcad_worker/methods.py) with module-level last_program cache per design §5. Cache verified via monkeypatch test + live integration: 4249× speedup on warm path. Cube → 12 structured edges; sphere → 0 (correct). LexError mapping fix added (evaluate_source only wraps ParseError/TranslatorError; LexError leaks through and was getting kind: python — now explicitly caught and mapped to kind: parse). 383 pytest pass / 0 skip / 0 fail with build123d 0.10.0. Off-tree class_name fix bundled (Cad_AnnotationHost / OrbitCamera moved to preload + base-class typing); documented in CADPanel.gd docstring and as Plan comment 238. Reviewer notes deferred (cache fragility, tolerance coverage gap, internal/tools/ lacks Go tests). Cosmetic 4-view layout issue surfaced and filed as new grandchild 019dccbfea88."}
