{"_type":"item","id":"019dc0bc2f387f78a768e12e2da8f7b5","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"Slide document model: types (title/section/main) + tile layouts + mixed content","created_at":"2026-04-24T18:24:11","updated_at":"2026-05-03T08:22:34","tags":["model","presentation"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0bbfcc57d81b4ac1300d4923094","resolution":"Slide document model shipped. ~/github/plugins/presentation/ui/slide_model.gd: pure-data API with constructors, validators, mutators, helpers (~370 lines). Three tile kinds: text (BBCode bold/italic/strikethrough + plain/bullet/numbered modes), image (base64-embedded), spreadsheet (mirrors SpreadsheetCell.to_dict() format). 0..1 normalized slide-relative coords. Optional per-slide title (omit-when-default). Reveal annotation-id list reserved for T4. SlideEditorPanel.gd wired to model: validates on save (warns but saves anyway to preserve work), validates on load (falls back to fresh deck on bad input). 84 SceneTree-based headless tests in ~/github/plugins/presentation/test/test_slide_model.gd, all passing. Cold review: SHIP. HITL smoke test passed via /tmp/sample_deck.mdeck (3 slides loaded, slide count display correct). Manifest + plugins.json cache updated to list slide_model.gd. Four durable gotchas pinned: project_plugin_class_name_prefix_rule.md, project_plugin_host_owned_schema.md, project_godot_json_int_to_float.md, project_presentation_llm_edit_model.md."}
