{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dac8d5fd1742ca093d65019854a44","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-04-20T21:51:15","note":"in_progress → done. Spike SUCCESS — all 4 gates validated. Gate 1 (caret): CEF renders HTML caret via hidden LineEdit IME proxy. Gate 2 (typing): keys reach the input. Gate 3 (IPC): window.sendIpcMessage(JSON.stringify(obj)) → Godot ipc_message signal works; also ipc_data_message and debug_ipc_message available. Gate 4 (file://): local HTML loads without extra config. Known quirk: input can freeze intermittently during typing, clicking any button un-freezes; not a blocker, needs follow-up investigation. Vulkan accelerated OSR is broken on Minerva's NVIDIA/mutter stack; force software rendering via enable_accelerated_osr=false. Full findings saved to hint godot-cef/integration-essentials."}
