{"_type":"event","item_id":"019de0cfaed77e30af1215849df57f47","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-01T00:09:26","note":"in_progress → done. AnnotationCanvas promoted from constants holder to substrate-owned positioned-item canvas. Extends AnnotationOverlay (mouse-filter discipline + active tool routing). API: register_item_type/add_item/remove_item/update_item_position/update_item_bounds/update_item_payload/get_item/get_items/clear_items/bring_to_front/send_to_back/select_item/deselect_item/clear_item_selection/set_item_selection/get_selected_item_ids/hit_test/items_in_rect. _draw() delegates to per-type renderers and paints selection handles. Item interaction (drag/marquee) deferred to Round 3 manipulation tool. RENDER_BUDGET_CAP constant preserved. Test coverage: test/annotations_v2/test_overlay_canvas.gd 16 canvas-side tests passing. No regressions in existing annotation suite."}
