{"_type":"event","item_id":"019df41a2c1e72a591a6e8bc1131f99b","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-04T18:04:45","note":"in_progress → done. Shipped: presentation_list_tiles, presentation_list_annotations, presentation_get_tile, presentation_get_slide. Headless test 72/0 (38 new asserts). Image tile src omitted by default in all inspect outputs (src_size_bytes hint instead); include_src=true on get_tile and include_tile_src=true on get_slide opt-in to base64. Text content capped at 8 KB with _truncated marker. Annotation summarization is best-effort opaque-envelope; defaults resolved=false until substrate work_item 019df41ace3b lands the field."}
