{"_type":"event","item_id":"019df41a5bda72e69785e20c090ab9d5","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-04T18:28:48","note":"in_progress → done. Shipped: presentation_modify_tile, presentation_set_slide_title, presentation_set_aspect, presentation_move_slide. 98/0 (+26 asserts). modify_tile is field-by-field optional; image-source replacement uses the same 4-source set as add_image_tile (mutually exclusive). rotation=0 erases the field per omit-when-default. Cross-kind field validation (content/text_mode rejected on image tiles, image sources rejected on text tiles)."}
