{"_type":"event","item_id":"019df41afdf2757fb1139f51368701c3","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-04T18:39:04","note":"in_progress → done. Shipped: presentation_add_annotation, presentation_remove_annotation, presentation_set_annotation_resolved, presentation_list_annotation_kinds, presentation_list_open_annotations. 156/0 (+33 asserts). Envelopes built server-side as substrate v2 shape (id, kind, schema_version=2, anchor, kind_payload, lifecycle, author, view_context, visible_in_views, summary). LLM-facing API takes only kind + summary + optional anchor/kind_payload/lifecycle. Summary mirrored into kind_payload.text for callout/text_2d when caller didn't specify. set_annotation_resolved supports both bool (true→resolved, false→open) and explicit lifecycle (for applied/stale). Optional note appends to resolution_notes audit trail. list_open_annotations cross-slide filters lifecycle==\"open\". remove_annotation also scrubs reveal[] references and removes the annotations key when empty. HITL gap: not yet verified that substrate UI's annotation tools write to slide.annotations[] — need restart + try-it-in-app."}
