{"_type":"event","item_id":"019df41b25a27be6bc97bb7c5b50694a","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-04T18:42:57","note":"in_progress → done. Shipped: presentation_add_spreadsheet_tile, presentation_modify_spreadsheet_cells, presentation_resize_spreadsheet. 193/0 (+37 asserts). Cell types mirror Presentation_SlideModel constants (0=empty, 1=text, 2=number, 3=date, 4=formula). _normalize_cell auto-types bare scalars (string→text, number→number, \"=\"-prefix→formula); explicit type validates against the enum. modify_spreadsheet_cells is a sparse patch list with skipped[] for OOB rows/cols (continues processing valid entries). resize_spreadsheet preserves overlap on grow/shrink, fills new cells with CELL_EMPTY. Pixel-rect (w/h) decoupled from grid dimensions — use modify_tile to change w/h."}
