{"_type":"event","item_id":"019df8e2d0937613a326389a4df133fb","seq":10,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-12T05:26:58","note":"reviewing → shipped. DCR shipped 2026-05-12. Generic bidirectional host interface for plugin-owned MCP tools is complete. Six T-level child tasks done across the rollout (T1-T7 + T7 case-6 follow-up). Phase 5 substrate (JSON Patch + Pointer + blob store + GC + R7 architectural fix). T6 + T6 tail completed every presentation MCP tool migration — MCPPresentationTools.gd deleted entirely from core. T7 integration tests green: case-6 regression guard \"ZERO minerva_presentation_* in core\" passes via test_presentation_plugin_parity.gd (30/30).\n\nFinal cumulative test counts:\n- channel 32/32, documents 72/72, mutate 36/36, cad smoke 37/37, presentation parity 30/30\n- Plugin Go suite ~110 tests\n- DCR substrate tests: blob_store 64/0, host_capability_documents_patch_put 82/0, host_capability_documents_get_node_blob 43/0, resolve_editor_buffer 9/0\n\nNew substrate landed: host capability channel; host.documents.{list_open, get_state, set_state, mark_dirty, get_node, get_blob, patch_state, put_blob}; host.files.{read, write}; host.editors.{list, export, open}; host_owned_save panel-state IPC; host_owned_save _ui_state piggyback pattern; mcp.proxy + secrets dispatcher families; capability audit log; deny-by-default policy + rate limiting.\n\nBranch: user/imran/experiments/swarm (pushed to origin)."}
