{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dfa6727fc76a9af624d655be9983e","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-06T23:47:01","note":"in_progress → done. Buffer-canonical document model DCR 019dfa66 fully shipped. All 9 tasks (T1-T8 + T7.5 + T7.6) done. T7.6 closed with \"no target\" finding (CAD has no external-file deps); rest implemented.\n\nFinal state:\n* DocumentBuffer / DocumentRegistry / DiskAccess / PathResolver — buffer-canonical core.\n* minerva_doc_* MCP tool family — path-canonical surface.\n* FileWatcherService + WatcherRuntime + Reload/Keep dialog — external-change reconciliation.\n* host.fs.* broker channels — plugin-facing watcher capability.\n* CADPanel.gd paired_dsl adoption (live-edit, debounced re-eval, supersession).\n* Editor.gd DocumentRegistry attach/detach with refcount lifecycle.\n* Plugin substrate (render_mode: paired_dsl, layout_hint: side_by_side, platform-reserved channels attach_buffer/text_changed/detach_buffer).\n* Legacy minerva_file_* and minerva_cad_get_document_source removed; editor_* trio kept as scratchpad API.\n\nKnown gaps surfaced (out of scope, filed):\n* host_capabilities DCR 019df8e2d093 comment 327 — host.viewports.capture sub-spec for CAD vision-loop.\n* host.fs.* PathResolver sandbox (T7.5 comment 329) — defer to PluginPolicy.\n* Chores 019dfe1b482a (MCPEditorTools headless testability) and 019dfea6418a (migration mirror cleanup; partially obsolete post-T8).\n\nTests: 14 suites, 613/0. HITL: T4 buffer↔pane round-trip, T5 paired_dsl substrate, T6 CAD bursts, T7 Reload/Keep dialog via VSCode, T7.5 host.fs.changed label via VSCode."}
