{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dfa68477e72e8a0085875a748919f","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-06T19:42:17","note":"in_progress → done. All four DoD items shipped + cold-Opus-review fixes + HITL passed.\n\nT5.1 PluginDefinition._parse_panel_entry accepts render_mode (single|paired_dsl) and layout_hint (tabs|side_by_side); unknowns rejected.\n\nT5.2 PluginEditorRegistry exposes render_mode/layout_hint via resolve_extension; SingletonObject.open_file_at_path branches on paired_dsl into _open_paired_dsl which creates text editor + plugin scene editor and calls broker.attach_buffer_to_panel. Bug found during HITL: EditorPane.add_plugin_scene_editor's idempotency check matched any editor with the same file path, causing it to return the sibling text editor when called second. Fixed by tightening the match to (type=PLUGIN_SCENE, plugin_id, panel_name, file). Saved as hint minerva-ui/editor-pane-idempotency-by-file-only (019dfec71e1e).\n\nT5.3 PluginScenePanelBroker gained attach_buffer_to_panel / detach_buffer_from_panel. New platform-reserved channels attach_buffer / text_changed / detach_buffer push to scene.receive() bypassing ipc_channels allowlist (mirrors push_progress). Buffer attach/detach refcount integration with DocumentBuffer.attach()/detach(). Idempotent same-buffer re-attach is a no-op fast path.\n\nT5.4 plugins/test_paired_dsl/ stub: manifest with render_mode=paired_dsl + layout_hint=side_by_side, server.py implements cancel_eval ack, ui/Panel.gd buffers pre-_ready arrivals (avoids null-deref on synchronous initial attach push), emits cancel_eval on each text_changed to exercise scene→plugin round-trip.\n\nHITL 2026-05-06: opened ~/temp/sub.tdsl. Two tabs created (text editor + plugin scene panel). EchoLabel rendered initial text \"one\"; typing \"cat\" updated both panes live. Audit log confirmed buffer_attached, scene_push channel=text_changed, scene_allowed/scene_dispatched channel=cancel_eval round-trips.\n\nSubstrate-level limitations deferred:\n- Layout split (side_by_side hint plumbed through but EditorPane currently puts both editors in the same tab strip, not split).\n- Idempotency loop in open_file_at_path returns first match — closing only the render panel and reopening won't recreate it. TODO comment added at the loop.\n\nTests: 320 passing across PluginDefinition, PluginScenePanelBroker, PluginEditorRegistry, DocumentBuffer, PluginScenePanelHost, legacy_buffer_canonical, scene_panel_broker_progress."}
{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dfa687bed74c8a8ce0c691a7cb4eb","seq":1,"event_type":"created","timestamp":"2026-05-05T23:10:44","note":"Item created"}
{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dfa687bed74c8a8ce0c691a7cb4eb","seq":2,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-06T19:53:57","note":"backlog → open. T6 pre-flight complete. Plan: (1) manifest render_mode/layout_hint/cancel_eval channel; (2) CADPanel.gd receive() for attach_buffer/text_changed/detach_buffer with debounce + cancel_eval emit; (3) Go cancel_eval tool with inflight request_id→CancelFunc map; (4) HITL."}
{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dfa687bed74c8a8ce0c691a7cb4eb","seq":3,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-06T19:54:03","note":"open → in_progress. Starting T6 implementation. Direct mode + cold-Opus review before HITL."}
{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dfa687bed74c8a8ce0c691a7cb4eb","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-06T21:47:40","note":"in_progress → done. T6 done. CAD plugin adopted paired_dsl render mode. Manifest declares render_mode=paired_dsl + layout_hint=side_by_side + cad.cancel_eval channel. CADPanel.gd implements receive() for attach_buffer/text_changed/detach_buffer with 250ms debounce and cancel_eval emit; supersession check in _evaluate_and_render drops stale results; silent-return on kind=cancelled. Go side: cad.cancel_eval tool spec + main.go inflight request_id→CancelFunc map with mutex; cad.evaluate derives cancellable ctx; defer-based cleanup. 5 new Go tests cover register/cancel/no-op/duplicate paths; all pass. Cold Opus review found 2 SHOULD-FIX (empty-buffer toast spam + debounce timer survives detach), both applied. HITL: buffer-canonical → CAD render → live-update verified across narrow + wide layouts; rapid bursts (5 doc_edits in succession) showed no flicker, only the final value landed; programmatic edits via minerva_doc_edit propagate identically to keyboard edits. Vision-loop follow-up tracked as host.viewports.capture sub-spec in comment 327 on DCR 019df8e2d093."}
