{"_type":"event","item_id":"019dfa68ca3175829454b60bb0024460","seq":5,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-06T23:46:25","note":"in_progress → done. T8 done. Tool count 279 → 275 (boot-log confirmed).\n\nRemoved (4):\n* minerva_file_read → minerva_doc_read\n* minerva_file_write → minerva_doc_write + minerva_doc_save\n* minerva_file_edit → minerva_doc_edit + minerva_doc_save\n* minerva_cad_get_document_source → minerva_doc_read keyed on the editor's file path\n\nKept per scope revision (comment 330): minerva_get_editor_content / minerva_update_editor / minerva_save_editor — re-scoped as the scratchpad / unbacked-editor API. Their descriptions now steer LLMs toward minerva_doc_* for path-backed editors.\n\nCode surgery:\n* MCPCodeTools.gd, MCPCadTools.gd, MCPEditorTools.gd — registrations + handlers + dispatch entries removed for the four tools.\n* Stale strings updated in MinervaMCPServer.gd (tool_search example) and ReadTool.gd (comment).\n* src/Data/master.dct skills rewritten — \"File and Code Tools\" steps + tool_deps now use minerva_doc_*; \"Text Editor\" split into path-backed (minerva_doc_*) and scratchpad (editor_*) flows.\n\nTests:\n* test_legacy_buffer_canonical.gd deleted — its coverage shifts to test_mcp_doc_tools.gd (42/0) and test_external_change_watcher.gd (31/0).\n* test_mcp_cad_tools.gd — 4 cad_get_document_source subtests removed.\n* test_mcp_disk_tools.gd — test_disk_write_fires_external_change_when_buffer_exists rewritten to cover BOTH the clean→silent-reload and dirty→external_change_detected branches that minerva_disk_write now routes through (post-T7 dispatcher).\n* 14 suites total, 613/0.\n\nSequencing override accepted: DCR explicitly said T8 must not land in same release as T1-T7. Pre-flight grep confirmed no in-tree code, plugins repo, or active agent/skill files reference the deprecated names. User authorized.\n\nCommit 6a3ffba8 on user/imran/experiments/swarm.\n\nDCR 019dfa66 is now fully complete."}
